        <p>Support <strong>WE / VN / PH</strong> Servers.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feat glass reveal" data-d="1">
        <div class="feat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.4"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.4"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Esp / AimBot / Memory</h3>
        <p>Normal full functions cheat.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feat glass reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="feat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.1"></circle><path d="M12 2.8v2.6M12 18.6v2.6M2.8 12h2.6M18.6 12h2.6M5.6 5.6l1.9 1.9M16.5 16.5l1.9 1.9M18.4 5.6l-1.9 1.9M7.5 16.5l-1.9 1.9"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>ZM / PVE</h3>
