      </article>
      <article class="feat glass reveal" data-d="3">
        <div class="feat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 4.5h8v5.2a4 4 0 0 1-8 0V4.5z"></path><path d="M8 5.5H5.6A1.4 1.4 0 0 0 4.2 7v.6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3H8M16 5.5h2.4A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 19.8 7v.6a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H16"></path><path d="M12 13.8v2.8M9.4 19.4h5.2M9.4 16.6h5.2v2.8H9.4z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Special!</h3>
        <p><strong>More special functions.</strong></p>
      </article>
